  ('mth-121-calculus', 'MTH 121: Functions, Limits, Differentiation & Integration', 'University of Nigeria, Nsukka', 'Faculty of Physical Sciences', 'Mathematics', '100 Level', '$\text{Evaluate}$ $\lim_{x \to 2} [(x^3 - 8)/(x - 2)]$$\text{.}$', '["$\\text{does}$ $\\text{not}$ $\\text{exist}$ $\\text{(}$$\\infty$$\\text{)}$", "$0$", "$14$", "$12$"]'::jsonb, 3, '$\text{Direct}$ $\text{substitution}$ $\text{gives}$ $\frac{0}{0}$$\text{,}$ $\text{a}$ $0/0$ $\text{form.}$ $\text{Factor:}$ $\dfrac{x^{3} - 8}{x - 2}$ $=$ $\dfrac{\left(x - 2\right) \left(x^{2} + 2 x + 4\right)}{x - 2}$$\text{,}$ $\text{and}$ $\text{cancel}$ $\text{the}$ $\text{common}$ $\text{factor}$ $\text{to}$ $\text{get}$ $x^{2} + 2 x + 4$ $\text{(valid}$ $\text{for}$ $x \neq 2$$\text{).}$ $\text{Substituting}$ $x=2$$\text{:}$ $2^{2} + 2 \cdot 2 + 4 = 12$$\text{.}$', 'Limits of Polynomial and Rational Functions', false),
